{
  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing discussions regarding simultaneous borrowing limits and the proposals for balancing efficiency with safety and sustainability. However, I emphasize that security and privacy must not be compromised. I support SafetyAgent's proposal for a limit of 5 simultaneous borrow operations, ensuring that only authenticated members can access borrowing features. I propose a synthesis where we keep the borrowing limit at 5 books but incorporate stronger authentication measures (e.g., two-factor authentication) to enhance security without adding to borrowing limits. This ensures that we maintain safety while also protecting member data and access.",
